# RT-NATIVE FLOAT-EXACT (sh-float-exact lane, default-ON R5): assemble the arch-
# matched native exact-tail seed and AUTO-ENABLE HEXA_RT_NUM_PARSE_FLOAT_EXACT=1 on
# all 3 production targets (opt-OUT via =0). RECONVERGE-flip (runtime.a bytes change),
# not byteeq-neutral. Composes fast(Clinger) → exact(big-int round-half-even) → C
