# ONLY when it is explicitly requested (zero-c #29 LAST reducible). byteeq-NEUTRAL
# while OFF (emitter #ifdef block dead → runtime.c byte-identical). Composes
# fast(Clinger) → exact(big-int round-half-even) → TAIL(hex/inf/nan bit-exact) → C
# strtod in __hexa_num_parse_float's NATIVE arm. Default-ON flip is a later 3-target
# byteeq RECONVERGE-flip gated on the tail-corpus-vs-host-libc oracle (glibc+Apple).
resolve_native_float_parse_hexinfnan_seed
# RT-NATIVE REGEX (regex-flip wiring follow-on, default-OFF opt-IN): assemble the
# arch-matched native regex_rt seed and enable HEXA_REGEX_NATIVE=1 ONLY when explicitly
# requested (zero-c #29 regex flip). byteeq-NEUTRAL while OFF (emitter #ifdef block dead
# → runtime.c byte-identical to the libc-regex baseline). ar's the 6 rt_regex_* shims
# into runtime.a so they resolve in a STANDALONE link (consent-checker + faithful) —
# closes the gap that reverted #4451 (convergence regex-rt-hexa-1). Default-ON flip is a
